  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "EMURGO as a DRep votes ABSTAIN on \"Cardano Strategic Copper Reserve | ₳22M RWA Tokenization\", with rationale outlined below.\n\nWith EMURGO having announced its upcoming deregistration as a DRep on 30 November 2026, our primary governance duty during this transition is capital preservation and the orderly wind-down of our voting mandate. Committing treasury reserves during an exit phase carries long-term consequences that future governance representatives should rightly decide.\n\nConsequently, our operating policy is to abstain on all discretionary funding actions, reserving affirmative support solely for rare initiatives that present an extraordinary, immediate strategic necessity for Cardano's foundational survival, network security, or global standing."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}